    apply (fire_via_ovf_lift tm Cc Hi (StB, S1)).
    intros p1 j1 E1. apply (fire_lift_of_csteps tm Cc).
    apply (fireo_0RB0LD_1RC1RB_1LD1RC_0LA1LA [SCycL 2 0; SWin 2; SCycR 2; SWin 4; SWinR 2] (StB, S1) ltac:(vm_compute; reflexivity)
